tests/.scratch-index-*/

# Link-checker CI artifacts (generated in the workflow, never committed)
link-failures.md
issue-body.md
# Finder-duplicate debris
* 2
* 2.*

# Written by generate-articles-index.mjs when an article is quarantined in
# lenient mode; consumed by deploy.yml's alert step, never committed.
quarantined-articles.txt

# CTF Backend Local Database & Cache
ctf_backend/data/
ctf_backend/**/__pycache__/
ctf_backend/.env

# Research atlas bundle: 516 objects / ~57MB, served from Cloudflare R2 at
# deniskim1.com/atlas/* via the worker. Deliberately NOT in git -- UMAP refits
# whenever the corpus changes, so nodes.json + edges.json (~19MB) are rewritten
# wholesale on every export and would accumulate in history permanently.
# Regenerate locally with build_atlas_data.py (next dev serves public/ directly),
# then publish with `node scripts/upload-atlas-r2.mjs --apply`.
public/atlas/

# wrangler's local state/cache
.wrangler/
